  "title": "Quick Fix Silky Algerian Vine Leaves Tagine",
  "description": "A quick and delicious Algerian-inspired dish featuring vine leaves, yuzu-cure, and a hint of mustardiness. This recipe is halal-friendly and can be prepared in under an hour.",
